  <item>
    <title>【河对岸080】Let’s move! 机智的搬家生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65caec1c5c5a3e3de480d49a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65caec1c5c5a3e3de480d49a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 04:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播的话】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anran：征一人永久帮我无偿搬家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ran：征一人送我房子！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生阶段的不同、租屋的更替让搬家成为了现代年轻人生活的常态。两位主播不约而同在近期又经历了这样的过程：Ran只是临时搬离家里几天，而Anran则收拾行囊进入了居住的新阶段：搬进自己的房子！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>熟悉我们的朋友也许知道，Anran是一位“搬家经验者”，曾经甚至一年搬过四次家。而伴随着搬家，还有装修、收拾东西、封箱开箱、收纳、清理等各个环节……本期节目，我们将谈谈在这些过程中，有何经验与感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> Anran搬进了新房子，Ran家进行了一个小翻新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 装修新家，漫长又花钱的旅程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 其实今天要聊的不是装修啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 搬家王Anran，一年搬4次！体验过哪些搬家方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 搬家前收拾东西时，你在想什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 搬家也是一种辞旧迎新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2326">38:46</a> 请人帮忙搬家，却总是无法心安理得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 在美国搬家更是炸裂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 收纳的魅力到底在哪里？过度收纳有必要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：梁咏琪 - 搬家</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：くるり - 琥珀色の街、上海蟹の朝</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅、分享我们的频道，或给我们反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/bilibili：河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:oppositetogenius@gmail.com"><span>oppositetogenius@gmail.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
