  <item>
    <title>【河对岸075】马什么松？马拉什么？什么拉松？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657d0b0204ef899e9906ded1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657d0b0204ef899e9906ded1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Dec 2023 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播的话】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ran：反正我是不会跑的！本以为在水但回听快笑死！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Anran：跑一场半马还是很赚的，比如可以水一集节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集节目要从Anran在11月跑了人生中第一场半程马拉松说起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着疫情开放，2023年全国路跑赛事回暖，据《2023中国田径协会路跑工作报告》数据显示，仅上半年备案的路跑赛事达133场。跑步市场在国内的快速发展让两位主播开始好奇，究竟是什么原因让如此多的人纷纷参与马拉松？长跑的魅力究竟何在？参与马拉松活动会带来怎样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 先来一些硬扯的尴尬开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">8:25</a> Anran分享跑马拉松的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 马拉松是什么？目标、契机、体验……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 应该办“相亲马拉松”“婚前马拉松”啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 跑步是个“便宜”的运动吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a> 马拉松拉动文旅，赛事各出奇招吸引跑者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 跑马大家还是要量力而行</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: Bruno Mars - Runaway Baby&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾: Shakira - Try Everything</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢河对岸有听友群啦！快从微博、公众号留言，来和我们一起聊天吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅、分享我们的频道，或给我们反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/bilibili：河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:oppositetogenius@gmail.com"><span>oppositetogenius@gmail.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
