  <item>
    <title>【河对岸073】如果我是DJ 你会爱我吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a4e655f5ff532ab7d2e05d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a4e655f5ff532ab7d2e05d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jul 2023 03:30:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说起DJ，你会想到什么？大音量、高BPM、夜店、蹦迪、电子乐......</span></p><span></span><p><span>说起女DJ，你又会想到什么？性感的身材、或是一片空白......</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，你将认识</span><strong><span>声音超好听的Rowling</span></strong><span>。在本职工作之外，她也是一位</span><em><span>Bedroom DJ</span></em><span>（与外出表演的专业DJ相比，更多在自家练习DJ技巧）、爵士歌手，更是音乐爱好者。在一小时的轻松谈话里，Rowling将柔和而清晰地解答两位主播关于DJ的弱智提问，并与我们分享她对这一职业的理解与热情。而她推荐的DJ组合</span><em><span>Girls Don't Sync</span></em><span>，更是具体地拓展了我们对女性DJ形象的想象。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>来与我们一起想象掌握音乐的快乐，想象被音乐拥抱的幸福吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">4:19</a> 一些开场傻问题：DJ具体做什么？歌曲用什么版本？一场要准备多少音乐？......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 录音前夜，Rowling是怎么嗨到嗓子都哑了的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> DJ选择的歌曲一定都是动次动次的快歌吗？嗨歌≠节奏快</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 看DJ演出，或自己成为DJ的门槛高吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> “好的DJ是30%的技术加70%的品味”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> Rowling推荐的Girls Don't Sync，如何丰富对女性DJ形象的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> 热爱音乐，热爱生活（常常熬夜要注意养生）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Rowling推荐的歌曲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Aluna/Kaytranad/Rema - The Recipe</span></p><span></span><p><span>Janet Jackson/Kaytranada - If (Kaytranada Remix)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Disclosure - When A Fire Starts To Burn</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Girls Don't Sync演出(YouTube): </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwDkAHqZ-yY" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwDkAHqZ-yY"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: &nbsp;Janet Jackson - If (Kaytranada Remix)</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾: Higgo - Crush</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢河对岸有听友群啦！快从微博、公众号找到二维码，来和我们一起聊天吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅、分享我们的频道，或给我们反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索：@河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:oppositetogenius@gmail.com"><span>oppositetogenius@gmail.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
