  <item>
    <title>【河对岸072】北美Kpop站姐的佛系日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6440b7db22fb77a371f1520f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6440b7db22fb77a371f1520f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Apr 2023 03:36:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播的话】</span></p><span></span><p><span>安然：大家都去听Kpop</span></p><span></span><p><span>然：前几天在地铁站看到Seventeen成员的大屏，站在原地想了10秒他是谁。认人速度还有待提升。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>嗨，你听到过“雾都雾里七个八”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一片段的流行，间接地让我们想起曾经同住波士顿的好朋友：贝。贝正是Seventeen的粉丝，在疫情将我们阻隔的这几年里，她更是完成了身份“升级”，成为了一名驻北美Kpop站姐。本期节目，我们就请到贝，来和我们一起谈谈她追Kpop的这些年，以及佛系北美站姐的日常。在久违的老友聊天中，我们也像穿越回了波士顿，感到惬意与温暖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">3:14</a> 贝追Kpop的历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 历经多年，终于要追到Seventeen了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> Ran从零开始学Kpop的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 贝成为站姐的心路历程与日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> 追日本团体久了，“饭拍”也是一种cultural shock</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> “当你看到一张小卡1200块的时候，就会觉得自印好了，我妥协”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a> 唯粉 vs. 团粉，拉踩真的有必要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2927">48:47</a> 个人直拍、一镜到底... 现在的舞台物料好卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">54:40</a> 时间快进到...Kpop成功闯美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3537">58:57</a> 韩国文化输出做得好成功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3848">1:04:08</a> 各团概念和世界观越来越新</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4173">1:09:33</a> 慢慢成长和火起来的团有独特的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头: SEVENTEEN - 'HOT'&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾: ALEPH - No One Told Me Why</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢河对岸有听友群啦！快从微博、公众号找到二维码，来和我们一起聊天吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家订阅、分享我们的频道，或给我们反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>bilibili：河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博搜索：@河对岸OTG</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:oppositetogenius@gmail.com"><span>oppositetogenius@gmail.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
